                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this game at a 90% discount. I am recommending it STRICTLY within these conditions.\n\nIt's a fast-paced, borderline rage-bait obstacle runner. Think \"what if I wanted to make Super Meat Boy, had two dollars and a can of coke for the budget, and targeted the Touhou demographic?\".\n\nIt's supremely janky from the controls to the graphics and presentation, and front-loaded with the weakest levels, but if you have the tolerance for dying literal hundreds of times as you memorize and master complicated obstacle courses, this is honestly decent fun, and has some surprisingly well-thought-out levels and gimmicks. The later bosses are insanely overtuned and unfun, so beware.",
